<span id="A1.p2.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.05em;">
<span id="A1.p2.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p2.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">You are a helpful question answerer who can provide an answer given a question and relevant context.
